<title>PAKISTAN: Port conditions Pakistan/Morocco - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions Pakistan/Morocco - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>Pakistan</p>
<p>Karachi, April 8 - Vessels waiting off port - one general cargo waiting two days, one container waiting one day, one fertiliser waiting two days, one loader waiting six days and one oil tanker waiting three days.</p>
<p>Morocco</p>
<p>Casablanca, April 7 - Port conditions Safi - delay for phosphate vessels one day.</p>
</text>
